OL,5,G0000 Taggart
OL,6,     FNew DCI Matt Burke takes over the
OL,7,     Fcase of the murder of a
OL,8,     Fpolitician's activist son, who
OL,9,     Fthreatened his father's property
OL,10,     Fdeal. Is Jardine too close to the
OL,11,     Ftruth?
OL,12,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FLocked down in their cells, the
OL,14,     Fwomen try to figure out the
OL,15,     Fsignificance of the gunfire. Vera
OL,16,     Ffeels her grip slipping, and Judy
OL,17,     Finstigates a truth game.
